<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="profile" href="http://gmpg.org/xfn/11"><link rel="pingback" href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/xmlrpc.php"><script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=UA-167984142-1"></script><script>window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || []; function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);} gtag('js', new Date()); gtag('config', 'UA-167984142-1');</script><link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/apple-touch-icon.png"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/favicon-32x32.png"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/favicon-16x16.png"><link rel="manifest" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/site.webmanifest"><link rel="mask-icon" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/safari-pinned-tab.svg" color="#5bbad5"><link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/favicon.ico"><meta name="msapplication-TileColor" content="#2b5797"><meta name="msapplication-config" content="/fi/browserconfig.xml"><meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff"><script>function fvmuag(){if(navigator.userAgent.match(/x11.*fox\/54|oid\s4.*xus.*ome\/62|oobot|ighth|tmetr|eadles|ingdo/i))return!1;if(navigator.userAgent.match(/x11.*ome\/75\.0\.3770\.100/i)){var e=screen.width,t=screen.height;if("number"==typeof e&&"number"==typeof t&&862==t&&1367==e)return!1}return!0}</script><title>Demerara Bank Limited | Guyana Stock Exchange Inc.</title><meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:title" content="Demerara Bank Limited | Guyana Stock Exchange Inc."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-bank-limited/"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Guyana Stock Exchange Inc."/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Demerara Bank Limited | Guyana Stock Exchange Inc."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-bank-limited/"/><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@id":"https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/","name":"Guyana Stock Exchange Inc."}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@id":"https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security-type/ordinary-shares/","name":"Ordinary Shares"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@id":"https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-bank-limited/","name":"Demerara Bank Limited"}}]}</script><style type="text/css" media="all">@font-face{font-family:'Noto Serif';font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-stretch:normal;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/notoserif/v33/ga6saw1J5X9T9RW6j9bNfFIMZhhWnFTyNZIQD1-_FXP0RgnaOg9MYBNLg_cIrq0.woff) format('woff')}@font-face{font-family:'Noto Serif';font-style:italic;font-weight:700;font-stretch:normal;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/notoserif/v33/ga6saw1J5X9T9RW6j9bNfFIMZhhWnFTyNZIQD1-_FXP0RgnaOg9MYBOshPcIrq0.woff) format('woff')}@font-face{font-family:'Noto Serif';font-display:block;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-stretch:normal;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/notoserif/v33/ga6iaw1J5X9T9RW6j9bNVls-hfgvz8JcMofYTa32J4wsL2JAlAhZqFCTx8cM.woff) format('woff')}@font-face{font-family:'Noto Serif';font-display:block;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;font-stretch:normal;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/notoserif/v33/ga6iaw1J5X9T9RW6j9bNVls-hfgvz8JcMofYTa32J4wsL2JAlAhZT1eTx8cM.woff) format('woff')}</style><link rel='stylesheet' id='fvm-header-0-css' href='https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/cache/fvm/1759280682/out/header-39879a3be031dd10f0fc341162d58b61f5b4420e.min.css' type='text/css' media='all'/><script type='text/javascript' src='https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/wp-includes/js/jquery/jquery.js' id='jquery-core-js'></script><script type='text/javascript' src='https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/assets/js/chart.js' id='chart-js'></script><script type='text/javascript' src='https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/cache/fvm/1759280682/out/header-3afae13aa1a25beeb109a30bd2eaf7523b55eb03.min.js' id='fvm-header-1-js'></script><link rel="https://api.w.org/" href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/wp-json/"/><style type="text/css">.recentcomments a{display:inline !important;padding:0 !important;margin:0 !important;}</style></head><body class="security-template-default single single-security demerara-bank-limited security dwpb-push-page group-blog"><div id="page" class="site"> <a class="skip-link screen-reader-text" href="#content">Skip to content</a> <header id="masthead" class="site-header" role="banner"><div class="site-contact group"><div class="wrapper group"><div class="dropdown"><div class="menu-label">Help</div> <nav class="help-menu"><div class="menu-help-container"><ul id="menu-help" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/faqs/">FAQs</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/glossary/">Glossary</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/buying-selling-shares/">Buying &#038; Selling Shares</a></li></ul></div> </nav></div> <nav class="secondary"><div class="menu-secondary-container"><ul id="menu-secondary" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/about-us/">About Us</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/articles/">Articles</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/legal-framework/">Legal Framework</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/news/">News</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/links/">Links</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/previous-website/">Previous Website</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div><div class="site-nav"><div class="site-branding row wrapper"><div class="site-logo col span-4"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com" title="Guyana Stock Exchange Inc." ><img width="4800" height="1800" src="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo.png" class="attachment-full size-full" alt="" loading="lazy" srcset="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo.png 4800w, https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo-800x300.png 800w, https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo-1600x600.png 1600w, https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo-200x75.png 200w, https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo-768x288.png 768w, https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo-1536x576.png 1536w, https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo-2048x768.png 2048w, https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/gse_logo-600x225.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 4800px) 100vw, 4800px"/></a></div><div class="site-menu col span-8"> <nav class="mobile"><div class='menu-label'>MENU</div><div class="menu-btn" id="menu-btn"> <span></span> <span></span> <span></span></div><div class="responsive-menu"><div class="menu-primary-container"><ul id="menu-primary" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/ai-tutor/">AI Tutor</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/trades/">Trades</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/financials/">Financials</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/market-capitalisation/">Market Capitalisation</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/securities/">Securities</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/brokers/">Brokers</a></li></ul></div><div class="menu-secondary-container"><ul id="menu-secondary-1" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/about-us/">About Us</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/articles/">Articles</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/legal-framework/">Legal Framework</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/news/">News</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/links/">Links</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/previous-website/">Previous Website</a></li></ul></div><div class="menu-help-container"><ul id="menu-help-1" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/faqs/">FAQs</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/glossary/">Glossary</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/buying-selling-shares/">Buying &#038; Selling Shares</a></li></ul></div></div> </nav> <nav class="primary"><div class="menu-primary-container"><ul id="menu-primary-1" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/ai-tutor/">AI Tutor</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/trades/">Trades</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/financials/">Financials</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/market-capitalisation/">Market Capitalisation</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/securities/">Securities</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/brokers/">Brokers</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div> </header> <main id="site-content" class="site-content"><div class="site-ticker"><div class="wrapper"><div class="stock-ticker"><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/banks-dih-holdings-inc/">bdh</a></div><div class="closing">155</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/guyana-bank-for-trade-and-industry-limited/">bti</a></div><div class="closing">2500</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/citizens-bank-guyana-incorporated/">cbi</a></div><div class="closing">388</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/caribbean-container-incorporated/">cci</a></div><div class="closing">149</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-bank-limited/">dbl</a></div><div class="closing">279</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="negative"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-distillers-limited/">ddl</a></div><div class="closing">295</div><div class="change"><span>-</span>2 (0.67%)</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-tobacco-company-limited/">dtc</a></div><div class="closing">3000</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/guyana-stockfeeds-incorporated/">gsi</a></div><div class="closing">112</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/j-p-santos-company-limited/">jps</a></div><div class="closing">20</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/property-holdings-incorporated/">phi</a></div><div class="closing">14</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="negative"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/republic-bank-guyana-limited/">rbl</a></div><div class="closing">539.9</div><div class="change"><span>-</span>0.1 (0.02%)</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/rupununi-development-company-limited/">rdl</a></div><div class="closing">500</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/sterling-products-limited/">spl</a></div><div class="closing">841.5</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="feature background group" style="background:url(https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/Capture-1.png) no-repeat center 50%; background-size:cover;"><div class="overlay"><div class="wrapper"><div class="content"><h1><div class="title">Demerara Bank Limited</div></h1></div></div></div></div> <main id="main" class="site-main wrapper group" role="main"><div class="sidebar col span-3"><div class="feed"><div class="bulletins"><h3>Bulletins</h3><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26514" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Limited (DBL) &#8211; recommends $1.00 per share Interim Dividend for 2026</a></div><div id="26514" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Bank Limited met on April 16, 2026 and recommended an Interim Dividend of $1.00 per share for the half-year ended March 31, 2026 payable on May 15, 2026.</p></div><span class ="number 219"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/219/">Bulletin 219</a></span><span class="date">April 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#25637" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; recommends $3.20 per share Final Dividend for 2025</a></div><div id="25637" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Bank Ltd met on October 24, 2025 and recommended a Final Dividend of $3.20 per share for 2025, subject to approval by Shareholders at the Annual General Meeting. This is in addition to an Interim dividend of $0.80 per share paid earlier.</p></div><span class ="number 215"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/215/">Bulletin 215</a></span><span class="date">October 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24809" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Limited (DBL) &#8211; recommends $0.80 per share Interim Dividend for 2025</a></div><div id="24809" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Bank Limited met on April 16, 2025 and recommended an Interim Dividend of $0.80 per share for the half-year ended March 31, 2025 payable on May 15, 2025.</p></div><span class ="number 212"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/212/">Bulletin 212</a></span><span class="date">April 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24178" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; Final Dividend for 2024</a></div><div id="24178" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Bank Ltd advise that their 30th Annual General Meeting will be held on December 20, 2024 at the Bank&#8217;s Head Office, 214 Camp Street, North Cummingsburg, G/town and the Final Dividend of $2.40 will paid to shareholders on December 23, 2024.</p></div><span class ="number 209"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/209/">Bulletin 209</a></span><span class="date">November 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24177" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; recommends $2.40 per share Final Dividend for 2024</a></div><div id="24177" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Bank Ltd met on October 18, 2024 and recommended a Final Dividend of $2.40 per share for 2024, subject to approval by Shareholders at the Annual General Meeting. This is in addition to an Interim dividend of $0.60 per share paid earlier.</p></div><span class ="number 209"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/209/">Bulletin 209</a></span><span class="date">November 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24170" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Limited (DBL) &#8211; recommends $0.60 per share Interim Dividend for 2024</a></div><div id="24170" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Bank Limited met on April 17, 2024 and recommended an Interim Dividend of $0.60 per share for the half-year ended March 31, 2023 payable on May 15, 2024.</p></div><span class="date">April 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#22435" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; Appointment of New CEO</a></div><div id="22435" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Mr. Pravinchandra Dave retires from the bank with effect from December 31, 2023. Mr. Dowlat Parbhu has been appointed Chief Executive Officer effective January 1, 2024.</p></div><span class ="number 201"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/201/">Bulletin 201</a></span><span class="date">December 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#22143" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; recommends $1.80 per share Final Dividend for 2023</a></div><div id="22143" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Bank Ltd met on October 26, 2023 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.80 per share for 2023, subject to approval by Shareholders at the Annual General Meeting. This is in addition to an Interim dividend of $0.45 per share paid earlier.</p></div><span class ="number 200"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/200/">Bulletin 200</a></span><span class="date">October 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#21109" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Limited (DBL) &#8211; recommends $0.45 per share Interim Dividend for 2023</a></div><div id="21109" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Bank Limited met on April 19, 2023 and recommended an Interim Dividend of $0.45 per share for the half-year ended March 31, 2023 payable on May 22, 2023.</p></div><span class ="number 194"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/194/">Bulletin 194</a></span><span class="date">April 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#20355" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; recommends $1.60 per share Final Dividend for 2022</a></div><div id="20355" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Bank Ltd met on November 16, 2022, and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.60 per share for 2022, subject to approval by Shareholders at the Annual General Meeting. This is in addition to an Interim dividend of $0.40 per share paid earlier. Dividends will be paid to shareholders on December 19, 2022.</p></div><span class ="number 190"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/190/">Bulletin 190</a></span><span class="date">November 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19057" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Limited (DBL) &#8211; Appointment of Chairman</a></div><div id="19057" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Mr. Komal Ram Samaroo is appointed  the new Chairman of the Board, replacing the late Dr. Yesu Persaud. The decision was taken at board meeting held on the 21st January, 2022. Prior to his appointment as Chairman on January 21, 2022, he is a long-serving Executive Director of Demerara Bank Limited that is instrumental in the bank&#8217;s growth and remains integrally involved in his strategic development.</p></div><span class ="number 183"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/183/">Bulletin 183</a></span><span class="date">February 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#18658" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; 27th Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="18658" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The 27h Annual General Meeting of Demerara Bank Limited will be held on December 21, 2021 at the Bank&#8217;s Head Office at 214 Camp Street, North Cummingsburg, Georgetown &#8220;in a manner as directed by Court Order No. 2021-HC-DEM-CIV-FDA-1489 Granted on November 16, 2021&#8221;.</p><p>The final dividend will be paid on December 22, 2021.</p></div><span class ="number 181"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/181/">Bulletin 181</a></span><span class="date">November 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#18271" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; recommends $1.60 per share Final Dividend for 2021</a></div><div id="18271" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Bank Ltd met on October 28, 2021 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.60 per share for 2021, subject to approval by Shareholders at the Annual General Meeting.</p></div><span class ="number 181"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/181/">Bulletin 181</a></span><span class="date">November 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17291" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Limited (DBL) &#8211; recommends $0.40 per share Interim Dividend for 2021</a></div><div id="17291" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Bank Limited met on April 21, 2021 and recommended an Interim Dividend of $0.40 per share for the half-year ended March 31, 2021 payable on May 14, 2021.</p></div><span class ="number 174"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/174/">Bulletin 174</a></span><span class="date">April 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16665" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; 26th Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="16665" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The 26th Annual General Meeting of Demerara Bank Limited will be held on December 18, 2020 at the Bank&#8217;s Head Office at 214 Camp Street, North Cummingsburg, Georgetown &#8220;in a manner as directed by Court Order No. 2020-HC-DEM-CIV-FDA-2017 Granted on November 19, 2020&#8221;. The final dividend will be paid on December 21, 2020.</p></div><span class ="number 171"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/171/">Bulletin 171</a></span><span class="date">November 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16403" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; 26th Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="16403" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Bank Limited wishes to advise that due to COVID-19 restrictions which prevents gatherings of more than ten(10) persons, would be unable to have its Annual General Meeting.</p><p>However, the bank has taken the decision to approach the High Court seeking an order to have its 26th Annual General Meeting on December 18th, 2020 which will be held virtually via Zoom or Microsoft Teams, as may be, at their Head Office &amp; Corporate Banking Branch, 214 Camp street, North Cummingsburg, Georgetown at 4:30pm.</p><p>Once the order is obtained, final dividend will be paid to shareholders on December 21, 2020 subject to the relevant  approvals.</p></div><span class ="number 171"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/171/">Bulletin 171</a></span><span class="date">November 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16404" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; recommends $1.25 per share Final Dividend for 2020</a></div><div id="16404" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Bank Ltd met on October 30, 2020 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.25 per share for 2020, subject to approval by Shareholders at the Annual General Meeting.</p></div><span class ="number 171"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/171/">Bulletin 171</a></span><span class="date">November 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#15854" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Limited (DBL) &#8211; recommends $0.25 per share Interim Dividend for 2019</a></div><div id="15854" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Bank Limited met on June 10, 2020 and recommended an Interim Dividend of $0.25 per share for the half-year ended March 31, 2020 payable on June 30, 2020.</p></div><span class ="number 166"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/166/">Bulletin 166</a></span><span class="date">June 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#15791" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Limited (DBL) &#8211; recommends $0.25 per share Interim Dividend for 2019</a></div><div id="15791" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Bank Limited met on June 10, 2020 and recommended an Interim Dividend of $0.25 per share for the half-year ended March 31, 2020 payable on June 30, 2020.</p></div><span class ="number 166"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/166/">Bulletin 166</a></span><span class="date">June 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#13156" class="inline-popup">Demerara Bank Ltd (DBL) &#8211; recommends $1.05 per share Final Dividend for 2019</a></div><div id="13156" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Bank Ltd met on October 21, 2019 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.05 per share for 2019, subject to approval by Shareholders at the Annual General Meeting.</p></div><span class ="number 161"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/161/">Bulletin 161</a></span><span class="date">October 2019</span></div></div></div></div></div><div id="primary" class="content-area col span-9"><h2> Financials</h2><div class="carousel financials financial-nav"><div class="slide" id="2026">2026</div><div class="slide" id="2025">2025</div><div class="slide" id="2024">2024</div><div class="slide" id="2023">2023</div><div class="slide" id="2022">2022</div><div class="slide" id="2021">2021</div><div class="slide" id="2020">2020</div><div class="slide" id="2019">2019</div><div class="slide" id="2018">2018</div></div><div class="small">-->Select Year</div><div class="slider financials financial-years"><div class="year slide" id="2026"><h3>2026</h3><div class="fin-data"><table class="financial-session"><thead><tr><th class="session">Session</th><th class="date">Session Date</th><th class="mnemonic">Last Trade Price(G$)</th><th class="name">EPS (G$)</th><th class="best bid">P/E Ratio</th><th class="vol bid">Dividends paid in last 12 monts (G$)</th><th class="best offer">Dividend Yield</th><th class="vol offer">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="trade" DBL><td class="session"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/financial_session/1154/">1154</a></td><td class="date">05/01/2026</td><td class="name">305.0</td><td class="best bid">18.69</td><td class="vol bid"